WEBVTT

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:36.140
Oh, that's...

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:38.370
You must be the culprit.

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:47.190
So, Kun-kun, you've come.

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:48.680
But it's already too late.

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:51.890
You're going to die here!

00:01:57.920 --> 00:02:00.900
Tears

00:02:03.190 --> 00:02:05.420
T-T-T-That was scary...

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:07.920
Oh, I can't stop shaking.

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:09.300
Scary!

00:02:09.740 --> 00:02:12.420
We have three supernatural dolls.

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:13.950
What are you talking about?

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:16.770
Y-You're both such children.

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:19.080
This is rare.

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:21.060
Kun-kun's on,
but you're not watching?

00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:22.540
What to do?

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:27.000
I have to go shopping now,
but I'm too scared to go alone.

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:28.460
Jun-kun, will you come... .

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:30.350
Get going by yourself already!

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:32.420
Come on!

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:33.060
Now...

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:48.100
Maybe I'll watch the afternoon news.

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:51.180
Aha...

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:53.600
Hurry up and decide where you're going.

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:55.060
I can't settle down.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:56.320
You're...

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:58.550
You're scared to be alone, aren't you?

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:02.900
You're supernatural phenomena.

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:04.790
Why are you getting scared?

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:09.230
Why you!

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:12.100
So the cursed doll
finally shows her true colors!

00:03:15.030 --> 00:03:19.040
Snack! Sweets! 
Thank you for the food!

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:21.710
Unyuu?

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:25.530
W-What's that look?

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:29.520
I thought you'd be scared to be alone
so I'm grudgingly near you.

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:30.870
Be grateful.

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:33.350
Hina didn't say anything.

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:38.210
Open the window.

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:40.190
You can do that much yourself.

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:46.200
Y-You...

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:49.700
It seems you still don't 
know your position.

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:51.470
D-Damn it...

00:03:55.770 --> 00:03:57.060
Happy now?

00:03:57.060 --> 00:03:57.710
Yes.

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:05.720
<i>Really, looking at her like this,
she hardly seems like a doll.</i>

00:04:07.490 --> 00:04:08.810
What are you looking at?

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.500
I-I wasn't.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:11.890
What's that about?

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:12.810
Really.

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:14.120
I'm a little disappointed.

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:17.660
Can't you tell?

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:20.800
How I truly feel...

00:04:20.930 --> 00:04:23.130
S-Shinku...

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:29.340
A joke. 
What's with the mood?

00:04:29.340 --> 00:04:30.870
Y-You!

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:34.310
You jinx of a demonic doll!
Always so pretentious!

00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:36.360
Take this PC!

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:36.370
Hey, look at me!

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:39.070
Take a look at this screen!

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:38.310
Are you listening,
 Shinku? Hey!

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:41.310
What are they doing?

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:40.750
Wow, it's amazing!

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:42.670
It's so bright!

00:04:41.310 --> 00:04:43.710
If it bothers you, you can just go see.

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:45.940
And this LCD is gentle on your eyes.

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:46.030
I-It doesn't really.

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:48.850
The specs are state-of-the-art too!

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:49.850
O-Of course, it's not like
I'm afraid to go into the hallway.

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:52.220
A complete software line.

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:50.890
Don't get weird ideas, damn you!

00:04:52.130 --> 00:04:54.330
Hina didn't say anything.

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:54.330
Spreadsheets and word processing.

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:58.020
And a simple e-mail program, 
White Goat Black Goat.

00:04:58.090 --> 00:05:01.880
We'll also throw in a printer that links to
digital cameras.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:01.120
Did you hear that just now?

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:02.310
Unyuu?

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:04.850
108,000 yen, tax included!

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:04.370
I don't hear anything.

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:06.030
I'm sure I heard something!

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:06.330
Not only that!

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:07.540
A rattling noise there!

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:10.480
With a set of two,
it's just 150,000 yen!

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:09.980
Really?

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:13.450
Don't you think a lot of guys
are into Fish King lately?

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.070
Close it.

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:34.590
What?

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:36.760
Got something to say?

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:39.290
Is there something
 you'd like me to say?

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:46.170
You're not honest.

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:48.760
Don't you tell me that!

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:51.440
You're the one with something to say.

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:54.250
But you don't know how.

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:57.200
And that's because you're uncertain.

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:00.370
W-What are you talking about?

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:03.760
If you're baiting me again, 
I'm not falling for it.

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:06.250
You're a lost child, aren't you?

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:10.540
Your heart is wandering
in search of a place to belong.

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:15.840
Poor Jun.

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:20.310
Where is your heart headed?

00:06:21.390 --> 00:06:22.590
I...

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:35.190
T-The noise came from here.

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:41.230
There's nothing here.

00:06:42.450 --> 00:06:44.170
Are you so sure?

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.840
T-T-T-T-That idiot...

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:52.250
No, that hippo has come 
to kill lovely me!

00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:54.850
It's just a stuffed animal.

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:06.620
I-I figured it was something like that.

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:09.660
What an irritating hippo, scaring me.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:12.130
I'll turn you upside 
down and into an idiot.

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:18.940
W-W-W-W-Where'd that voice come from?

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:21.930
Hina didn't say anything.

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:31.030
W-What?

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:32.050
Suiseiseki...

00:07:35.310 --> 00:07:36.690
Suiseiseki!

00:07:37.730 --> 00:07:40.180
Suiseiseki, what happened?

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:45.260
Hello, Shinku.

00:07:45.680 --> 00:07:47.020
Suigintou...

00:07:48.720 --> 00:07:52.570
I became terribly bored,
so I came to see you instead.

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:54.240
Be grateful.

00:07:54.730 --> 00:07:56.740
As glib as ever.

00:07:56.970 --> 00:08:00.080
S-Shinku, she's hurting me!

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:01.810
Let Hina-Ichigo go.

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:06.210
If you want her back,
 come over here.

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:09.280
Wait, Suigintou!

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:10.710
No!

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:12.680
I'll be waiting, Shinku.

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:21.530
Jun.

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:24.340
Jun, we're going.

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:27.360
H-Hey, this has to be a trap!

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:28.910
Calm down a little!

00:08:28.910 --> 00:08:30.410
I am calm.

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:33.210
Even knowing it's a trap,
 I must go.

00:08:33.940 --> 00:08:36.770
To bring an end to the 
Alice Game as well.

00:08:41.740 --> 00:08:43.300
Wake up, everyone.

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:45.270
I'll need your help.

00:08:52.430 --> 00:08:53.910
You needn't come.

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:56.840
You're still damaged from before.

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:02.700
All right.

00:09:03.030 --> 00:09:04.070
Come along.

00:09:08.050 --> 00:09:10.210
Oh, fine!

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:12.470
I just have to come, right?

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:31.030
I-I-It seems I've no choice.

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:33.730
I'll make an exception and come as well.

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:53.750
W-Where are we?

00:09:56.180 --> 00:09:57.930
What's with this place?

00:09:58.290 --> 00:10:00.080
It's Suigintou's world.

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:03.780
Watch out above you.

00:10:03.940 --> 00:10:04.500
Above?

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:18.060
I have so arrived!

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:20.140
There was no need.

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:23.200
Hey, get off me already!

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:24.640
Let's go.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:27.550
Suigintou is waiting
somewhere in this world.

00:10:32.570 --> 00:10:34.930
But what a strange place.

00:10:35.060 --> 00:10:36.530
It's full of crumbling homes.

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:41.200
This is a world created by Suigintou
that reflects her heart.

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:44.430
A world with poor taste like her.

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.840
I agree it's in poor taste, but...

00:10:47.820 --> 00:10:49.840
It's a lonely world.

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:58.290
How terrible.

00:10:58.290 --> 00:11:00.000
Poor thing!

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.750
We may be the same someday.

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:04.290
D-Don't say weird things.

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:05.020
It's not like you.

00:11:06.090 --> 00:11:07.180
You're right.

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:10.430
In short, I just have 
to win the Alice Game.

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:12.170
That's all there is to it.

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:23.540
If you lose the Alice 
Game, what happens?

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:27.780
I will revert to being 
an ordinary doll, or...

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:30.520
I will become like her.

00:11:31.340 --> 00:11:33.010
What's that mean?

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:34.940
What's the Alice Game?

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:37.690
Why do you have to fight 
till you're like this?

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:39.250
I...

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:41.040
Why else?

00:11:41.710 --> 00:11:43.690
To see Father.

00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:48.360
Suigintou!

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:52.800
Welcome.

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:55.370
Welcome to my field.

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:21.790
Shinku!

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:23.930
All for a stupid child...

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:27.930
You really are stupid 
to the core, Shinku.

00:12:28.820 --> 00:12:30.500
Hina's not stupid!

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:32.700
Stupid people call others stupid!

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:35.320
So you're the really stupid one!

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:37.010
Stupid! Stupid!

00:12:37.010 --> 00:12:40.440
It seems you don't understand
the position you're in.

00:12:43.870 --> 00:12:46.740
If I wish to break you, I could anytime.

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:50.960
Or would you like to see what it's like
to be junk like her?

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:57.350
I've come as you requested.

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:00.430
Return Hina-Ichigo now.

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:05.280
I'll return this whenever you'd like...

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:09.210
...as soon as you hand 
over your Rosa Mystica.

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:11.440
A foolish demand.

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:16.260
Handing over my Rosa Mystica
means defeat in the Alice Game.

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:19.780
I cannot afford to lose.

00:13:20.100 --> 00:13:23.140
I will end this fight.

00:13:24.810 --> 00:13:25.910
Such impudence...

00:13:30.140 --> 00:13:31.500
No!

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:34.130
This is my world.

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:36.520
Everything 
bends to my will.

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:39.300
Even your lives.

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:46.080
You boys...

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:49.310
What splendid knights you have.

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:50.550
Oh?

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:52.820
One of them looks familiar.

00:13:53.780 --> 00:13:55.160
How handsome.

00:13:55.340 --> 00:13:58.150
Pitiful, as befitting the defeated.

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:13.940
W-What's going on here?

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:18.870
There is nothing more hideous
than those who are incomplete.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:22.480
So I'll turn you all into junk too.

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:37.790
T-This is endless!

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:39.690
We should retreat!

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:41.060
It's no use.

00:14:42.760 --> 00:14:45.070
I-I can't breathe!

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:49.950
You boys, that's enough.

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:50.910
Run.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:52.910
Hurry! Run!

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:54.440
Farewell.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:55.440
Stop!

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:13.290
Shinku!

00:15:14.460 --> 00:15:15.430
Shinku!

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:20.330
I'll say it again.

00:15:20.910 --> 00:15:22.940
Hand over your Rosa Mystica.

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:24.940
I would rather die.

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:30.710
Then as you wish, I will let you die.

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:36.780
Shinku!

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:46.220
Farewell, Shinku.

00:15:49.240 --> 00:15:50.300
Shinku...

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:55.200
Shinku...

00:15:57.520 --> 00:15:58.770
Shinku...

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:03.740
Shinku!

00:16:08.990 --> 00:16:11.380
What is this power?

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:13.900
It couldn't be...

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:17.190
Jun.

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:18.880
A boy like him?

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:20.220
Impossible.

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:23.190
I will not accept that!

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:30.720
Holie.

00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:34.050
Oh no...

00:16:37.940 --> 00:16:38.990
Unii...

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:42.920
<i>T-This can't be...</i>

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:46.640
<i>I am losing in this world...</i>

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:53.420
<i>It can't be.</i>

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:05.440
<i>So it's the medium's power?</i>

00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:07.440
<i>That human's?</i>

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:11.780
Suigintou!

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:25.840
S-Saved...

00:17:25.840 --> 00:17:27.360
Thank you.

00:17:31.080 --> 00:17:32.140
That's right.

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:34.460
I'll bring an end to the Alice Game.

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:46.210
I-I feel more exhausted than usual.

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:48.440
It's because you used 
a lot of your power.

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:52.890
I don't care what happens anymore.

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:58.480
T-This...

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:00.860
We brought it all back...

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:03.840
Unyuu... He's all in pieces.

00:18:04.070 --> 00:18:05.890
It was so cruel.

00:18:06.690 --> 00:18:10.560
He may be a doll, but it's hard
to see him like this.

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:17.500
Poor thing.

00:18:19.420 --> 00:18:21.840
He is now lost.

00:18:22.880 --> 00:18:24.900
You mean that he's dead?

00:18:25.840 --> 00:18:28.350
There is no "death" for dolls.

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:31.420
We merely go somewhere far away.

00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:37.630
Existence is entirely conceptual.

00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:40.570
The concept that he is himself.

00:18:40.750 --> 00:18:43.560
A firm awareness that he is here.

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:50.040
If he believes that he does not
belong in this place...

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:52.610
that's the same as ceasing to exist.

00:18:53.280 --> 00:18:55.250
He will merely become a thing.

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:58.800
And that is a very lonely,

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:02.150
dark, cold,

00:19:03.300 --> 00:19:04.670
and sad thing.

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:14.690
Jun?

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:20.710
I think it was still here somewhere...

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:25.000
Found it.

00:19:25.820 --> 00:19:28.510
Shinku, l-let me see that clown.

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:33.780
What will you do, Jun?

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:35.180
All right.

00:19:47.250 --> 00:19:50.800
I'll say this now, that he won't be
exactly the way he was.

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:56.180
But I don't feel good leaving him
in pieces either, so...

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:12.520
Amazing, Jun.

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:15.180
To think you could do
something so amazing.

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:17.670
Y-You're overreacting.

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:20.280
It's just something 
I dabbled in long ago.

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:21.990
Or rather, it's not like I'm...

00:20:23.270 --> 00:20:24.480
Could it be...

00:20:30.970 --> 00:20:32.540
W-What's this?

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:33.920
Incredible...

00:20:34.530 --> 00:20:36.180
You called him back.

00:20:36.450 --> 00:20:40.520
His lost soul has returned to him.

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:43.480
I-I so can't believe it!

00:20:43.480 --> 00:20:45.820
To think the four-eyed 
brat could do this...

00:20:49.630 --> 00:20:52.660
Amazing, amazing!
 Jun, you're amazing!

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:58.270
Normally, a departed soul
cannot ever be restored.

00:20:58.630 --> 00:21:00.660
Except by those with considerable skill.

00:21:02.710 --> 00:21:04.670
You're wonderful, Jun.

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:10.200
It's as if your fingers 
produce a beautiful melody.

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:24.000
Well, I suppose you've done
adequately as my servant.

00:21:24.440 --> 00:21:25.690
W-Why you...

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:32.670
I'm home!

00:21:32.670 --> 00:21:35.400
I bought snacks, everyone!

00:21:35.740 --> 00:21:36.720
Nori!

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:38.660
Snacks, snacks!

00:21:38.660 --> 00:21:40.400
I'm thankful for the food!

00:21:40.710 --> 00:21:44.040
Damn, I was dumb for thinking
better of you, even a little.

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:46.170
Hey, aren't you coming?

00:21:53.420 --> 00:21:54.520
H-Hey...

00:21:55.070 --> 00:21:55.850
What's wrong?

00:21:56.300 --> 00:21:57.970
H-Hey, what's wrong?

00:21:57.970 --> 00:21:58.720
Hey!

00:21:59.840 --> 00:22:01.520
Shinku! Shinku!

00:22:03.860 --> 00:22:04.890
Shinku...

00:22:05.720 --> 00:22:08.110
Shinku! Shinku!

00:22:08.110 --> 00:22:09.570
Shinku!

00:23:42.040 --> 00:23:43.210
What'll we do?

00:23:43.210 --> 00:23:44.620
Shinku's not waking up.

00:23:44.900 --> 00:23:46.530
Hi, little lady.

00:23:46.530 --> 00:23:48.620
It seems you need my help.

00:23:48.620 --> 00:23:51.470
Yay! Kun-kun's come to help!

00:23:51.470 --> 00:23:53.600
Hm, I've deduced...

00:23:53.600 --> 00:23:54.340
I can't wait!

00:23:54.340 --> 00:23:56.830
I can't wake her. Why?

00:23:56.830 --> 00:23:58.800
Because I'm not an alarm clock.

00:23:58.800 --> 00:24:00.670
A-A brilliant deduction!

00:24:01.310 --> 00:24:03.210
Um, then... Um, um...

00:24:03.440 --> 00:24:10.910
Chapter 7
Dreams

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:05.490
Next time on Rozen Maiden!

00:24:05.640 --> 00:24:08.610
Huh? I feel like I'm 
forgetting something.
